          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man won Gibeon ubedo i Gibeon, Yeyel, ma nying’ dhaku pare Maka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wode ma kayu Abdon, man Zur, man Kic, man Bal, man Ner, man Nadab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man Gedor, man Ahio, man Zekaria, man Mikloth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Mikloth unyolo Cimeam. Man gin bende gibedo ku utumeggi i Yerusalem, yo kum uturneggi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Ner unyolo Kic; man Kic unyolo Saul; man Saul unyolo Yonathan, man Malkicua, man Abinadab, man Ecbal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wod Yonathan en e Merib-bal; man Merib-bal unyolo Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wot Mika gi eni: Pithon, man Melek, man Tarea, man Ahaz. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Ahaz unyolo Yara; man Yara unyolo Alemeth, man Azmaveth, man Zimri; man Zimri nyolo Moza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man Moza nyolo Binea; man Refaya ma wode, Eleasa ma wode, Azel ma wode. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Azel wote abusiel, ma nying’gi eni: Azrikam, man Bokeru, man Icmael, man Cearia, man Obadia, man Hanan: maeni gi wot Azel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
